38-4543-a64c-dbc378af5681','event','Belonging: Making Friends, Building Community 16/4/25','Belonging: Making Friends, Building Community',1742359551,1744805927,1744808400,'https://actionnetwork.org/events/belonging-building-friendships','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/event/belonging-building-friendships?format=js&source=widget\'></script><div id=\'can-event-area-belonging-building-friendships\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-whitelabel-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/event/belonging-building-friendships?format=js&source=widget\'></script><div id=\'can-event-area-belonging-building-friendships\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/event/belonging-building-friendships?format=js&source=widget\'></script><div id=\'can-event-area-belonging-building-friendships\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/event/belonging-building-friendships?format=js&source=widget&style=full\'></script><div id=\'can-event-area-belonging-building-friendships\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-whitelabel-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/event/belonging-building-friendships?format=js&source=widget&style=full\'></script><div id=\'can-event-area-belonging-building-friendships\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/event/belonging-building-friendships?format=js&source=widget&style=full\'></script><div id=\'can-event-area-belonging-building-friendships\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<h3><strong>Why We\'re Talking About Belonging</strong></h3><p>Last year we asked people with disability what supports they needed to live the life they wanted. Many people told us they wished they had more support to:\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  Make friends\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  Feel included in their community\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  Connect with others\r\n<span></span><span></span></p><h3><strong>What We\'ll Discuss</strong></h3><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  What does \"connecting to community\" really mean?\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  What kind of support helps people make friends?\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  What gets in the way of making connections?\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  How can we actually build inclusive communities?\r\n</p><p>This event is a chance to have honest conversations about friendship and community without all the jargon.\r\n<span></span><span></span></p><h3><strong>Your Participation Matters</strong></h3><p>People with disability are invited to share their:\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  Ideas\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  Solutions\r\n</p><p>● &nbsp; &nbsp;  Experiences\r\n</p><p>After registering, we\'ll invite you to fill in a short survey about your experiences. You don’t have to fill in the survey if you don’t want to.\r\n</p><p>If you do complete the survey, we will use your experience and ideas respectfully to create better conversations about belonging and community.</p>','O:8:\"stdClass\":5:{s:5:\"venue\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"locality\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"postal_code\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"country\";s:2:\"US\";s:8:\"location\";O:8:\"stdClass\":3:{s:8:\"latitude\";d:39.7837304;s:9:\"longitude\";d:-100.445882;s:8:\"accuracy\";s:7:\"Rooftop\";}}',0,0),(18,'0e616818-ae3a-47a1-8554-e41e7335fed8','form','EOI in being more involved in the DD ',' Want to be more involved in the Disability Dialogue?',1759272353,1762122904,NULL,'https://actionnetwork.org/forms/want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/form/want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue?format=js&source=widget\'></script><div id=\'can-form-area-want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-whitelabel-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/form/want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue?format=js&source=widget\'></script><div id=\'can-form-area-want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/form/want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue?format=js&source=widget\'></script><div id=\'can-form-area-want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/form/want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue?format=js&source=widget&style=full\'></script><div id=\'can-form-area-want-to-be-more-involved-in-the-disability-dialogue\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>','<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-whitelabel-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/form/want-to-be-more-involved-in-