on 4.1.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: save to database<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 4.1.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: fix conflict with Divi theme<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: fix conflict with form plugins<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 4.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Shortcode for iframe<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 4.0 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Live Preview Builder<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Vimeo support<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Shortcode for buttons<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Redirect after close the modal window<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Modal Window Schedule<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Test mode<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Activate\\/Deactvate the modal window<\\/li>\\n<li>Changed: Admin style<\\/li>\\n<li>Optimized: scripts and styles<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 3.0.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: bug with cookie<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 3.0.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: Editing text for the close window button<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: deleted wrong font<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 3.0 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Description for options<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Title for popup<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Style for title<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Shadow for popup<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Font setting for modal content<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: New format for close button and it style<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Shortcodes for columns<\\/li>\\n<li>Updated: FontAwesom icons for float button and Icon Generation to version 5<\\/li>\\n<li>Changed: Style of plugin admin page<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.3.3 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: Delay for option Leave page<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.3.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: background for the form button<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: functions for show and close popups<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: the function for sorting popups in the admin area<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: the function for displaying on the mobile device<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: displaying float button icon<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: function \'Posts in Category\'<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.3 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Hide a close button for a modal window<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: the function for autoclose a modal window<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: opening a modal window on\\u00a0right click of the mouse<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: opening a modal window on selected text<\\/li>\\n<li>Added:\\u00a0Rotate icon for a modal window button<\\/li>\\n<li>Optimized: style and scripts<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: show a modal window on\\u00a0the devices<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: conflict with animated style<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.2.4 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\u00a0Fixed: icon style<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.2.3 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: Color picker alfa<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: Shortcode output<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Translate file<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.2.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Support for the Youtube videos<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.2.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added:\\u00a0function \'Don\\u2019t show on screens more than\'<\\/li>\\n<li>Optimized:\\u00a0style and script<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added:\\u00a0function of create subscription or feedback form<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.1.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed:\\u00a0color picker alpha for Wordpress 4.9<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Support for display on taxonomy pages.<\\/li>\\n<li>Added:\\u00a0Show menu depending on user\'s role.<\\/li>\\n<li>Added:\\u00a0Support page<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.0.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: minor bugs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.0.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: overlay style<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: icon shortcode<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 2.0 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Display a modal window in posts of category with certain IDs;<\\/li>\\n<li>Changed: admin style<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: general style<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.4 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added:\\u00a0Style settings for the modal window button<\\/li>\\n<li>Added: Animation\\u00a0for the modal window button<\\/li>\\n<li>Added:\\u00a0Style settings for the modal window close button<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed: Saving modal window<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.8 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: modal window width for mobile<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.7 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed:\\u00a0minor bugs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.6 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: style for mobile<\\/li>\\n<li>Fixed:\\u00a0cookie<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.5 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed:\\u00a0minor bugs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.4 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed:\\u00a0minor bugs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.3 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added: Icons Generator<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed: cookie for a modal window;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Otimized: Data base;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.3 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Add: Different types of animation<\\/li>\\n<li>Change: Image of close button;<\\/li>\\n<li>Change: The admin style of modal window;<\\/li>\\n<li>Change:\\u00a0The preview of a modal window;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.2.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Add:\\u00a0Show modal window\\u00a0depending on user (for all users, only for logged-in users, only for not logged-in users)<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.2.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Add: Custom buttom for closing the modal window<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.2 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fix: Change function \'split\'<\\/li>\\n<li>Fix:\\u00a0Verifying access to the folder \'asset\'.<\\/li>\\n<li>Fix: Support and Facebook link.<\\/li>\\n<li>Fix: Save settings<\\/li>\\n<li>Fix:\\u00a0Optimized code.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.1 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed insert symbols<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>= Version 1.0 =<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Initial release<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\"},\"banners\":{\"high\":\"\",\"low\":\"\"},\"icons\":{\"1x\":\"https:\\/\\/wow-estore.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/edd\\/2017\\/06\\/wow-modal-windows-pro.jpg\",\"2x\":\"https:\\/\\/wow-estore.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/edd\\/2017\\/06\\/wow-modal-wi