wo clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(4101,478,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(4102,478,'page_col_image_2','436'),(4103,478,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(4104,478,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(4105,478,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(4106,478,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(4107,478,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(4108,478,'page_col_image_4','455'),(4109,478,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(4110,478,'sec_4_title','Location'),(4111,478,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(4112,478,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(4113,478,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(4114,478,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(4115,478,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(4116,478,'news_title','Project updates'),(4117,478,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(4118,478,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(4119,478,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(4120,478,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(4121,478,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(4122,478,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(4123,478,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(4124,478,'contact_title','Contact us'),(4125,478,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(4126,478,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(4127,478,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(4128,478,'news_button','<a class=\"btn b