energy each year.'),(21568,1101,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(21569,1101,'page_col_image_2','436'),(21570,1101,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(21571,1101,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(21572,1101,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(21573,1101,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(21574,1101,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(21575,1101,'page_col_image_4','455'),(21576,1101,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(21577,1101,'sec_4_title','Location'),(21578,1101,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(21579,1101,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(21580,1101,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(21581,1101,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(21582,1101,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(21583,1101,'news_title','Project updates'),(21584,1101,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(21585,1101,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(21586,1101,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(21587,1101,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(21588,1101,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(21589,1101,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(21590,1101,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(21591,1101,'contact_title','Contact us'),(21592,1101,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(21593,1101,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(21594,1101,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(21595,1101,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(21596