1703,'report_link_url','#'),(54043,1703,'_report_link_url','field_62f30ef4b57e3'),(54044,1703,'report_link_text','Download'),(54045,1703,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(54046,1703,'solutions_content','<strong>Sed varius sapien vitae nisl molestie gravida. Aenean ultrices tristique ex eu lobortis. Quisque quis urna ante. Mauris consequat sodales massa, et imperdiet risus gravida sit amet. Phasellus venenatis facilisis felis ut fringilla. Morbi quis efficitur neque.</strong>\r\n\r\nQuisque ultricies diam eu ipsum maximus facilisis. Aliquam erat massa, placerat vel nunc hendrerit, venenatis eleifend lorem. Vivamus fermentum, arcu vitae condimentum malesuada, arcu augue lacinia justo, sed interdum turpis dolor vitae nisl.\r\n\r\nIn pellentesque id ex vitae mattis. Sed nec ultrices mi. Integer mollis diam mi, sit amet auctor ex convallis ut. Mauris pretium, massa non efficitur lacinia, sapien turpis blandit erat, nec dictum turpis metus quis dolor. Interdum et malesuada fames ac ante ipsum primis in faucibus.'),(54047,1703,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(54048,1703,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(54049,1703,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(54050,1703,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70%'),(54051,1703,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(54052,1703,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(54053,1703,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(54054,1703,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','House prices have doubled in a decade'),(54055,1703,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(54056,1703,'problem_icons','4'),(54057,1703,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(54058,1703,'ceh_content_left',''),(54059,1703,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(54060,1703,'ceh_content_right',''),(54061,1703,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(54062,1703,'pc_content_left',''),(54063,1703,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(54064,