between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(69153,1853,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(69154,1853,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(69155,1853,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(69156,1853,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(69157,1853,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(69158,1853,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(69159,1853,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(69160,1853,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(69161,1853,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(69162,1853,'problem_icons','4'),(69163,1853,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(69164,1853,'ceh_content_left',''),(69165,1853,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(69166,1853,'ceh_content_right',''),(69167,1853,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(69168,1853,'pc_content_left',''),(69169,1853,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(69170,1853,'pc_content_right',''),(69171,1853,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(69172,1853,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(69173,1853,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(69174,1853,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(69175,1853,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(69176,1853,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text'