h targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(71053,1859,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(71054,1859,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(71055,1859,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(71056,1859,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(71057,1859,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(71058,1859,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(71059,1859,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(71060,1859,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(71061,1859,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(71062,1859,'problem_icons','4'),(71063,1859,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(71064,1859,'ceh_content_left',''),(71065,1859,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(71066,1859,'ceh_content_right',''),(71067,1859,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(71068,1859,'pc_content_left',''),(71069,1859,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(71070,1859,'pc_content_right',''),(71071,1859,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(71072,1859,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(71073,1859,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(71074,1859,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(71075,1859,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(71076,1859,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(71077,1859,'_problem