nal housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(72989,1866,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(72990,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(72991,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(72992,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(72993,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(72994,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(72995,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(72996,1866,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(72997,1866,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(72998,1866,'problem_icons','4'),(72999,1866,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(73000,1866,'ceh_content_left',''),(73001,1866,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(73002,1866,'ceh_content_right',''),(73003,1866,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(73004,1866,'pc_content_left',''),(73005,1866,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(73006,1866,'pc_content_right',''),(73007,1866,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(73008,1866,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(73009,1866,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(73010,1866,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(73011,1866,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(73012,1866,'problem_icons_