clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(78379,1876,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(78380,1876,'page_col_image_2','436'),(78381,1876,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(78382,1876,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(78383,1876,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(78384,1876,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(78385,1876,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(78386,1876,'page_col_image_4','455'),(78387,1876,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(78388,1876,'sec_4_title','Location'),(78389,1876,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(78390,1876,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(78391,1876,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(78392,1876,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(78393,1876,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(78394,1876,'news_title','Project updates'),(78395,1876,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(78396,1876,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(78397,1876,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(78398,1876,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(78399,1876,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(78400,1876,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(78401,1876,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(78402,1876,'contact_title','Contact us'),(78403,1876,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(78404,1876,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(78405,1876,'_contact_intro','field_5de798