ted’ than any other state or territory.'),(88345,1931,'_intro_icons_2_int_icon_text','field_64e828e33ada3'),(88346,1931,'intro_icons','3'),(88347,1931,'_intro_icons','field_64e828963ada1'),(88348,1931,'threat_head_major','What we stand to lose if we don’t act soon to protect beautiful Queensland:'),(88349,1931,'_threat_head_major','field_64ec258d9dbd1'),(88350,1931,'threats_icons','3'),(88351,1931,'_threats_icons','field_64ec2551a93f9'),(88352,1931,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon','1819'),(88353,1931,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(88354,1931,'threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','The rich cultural heritage of our First Nations people and their continuous ties to country, dating back more than 50,000 years.'),(88355,1931,'_threats_icons_0_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(88356,1931,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon','1819'),(88357,1931,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(88358,1931,'threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','Thousands of species of plant and animal which are now classified as threatened or endangered in Queensland.'),(88359,1931,'_threats_icons_1_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(88360,1931,'threats_icons_2_thr_icon','1819'),(88361,1931,'_threats_icons_2_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(88362,1931,'threats_icons_2_thr_icon_text','The access to nature that is central to the Queensland way of life.'),(88363,1931,'_threats_icons_2_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(88364,1931,'threat_icons_0_thr_icon',''),(88365,1931,'_threat_icons_0_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(88366,1931,'threat_icons_0_thr_icon_text','The <span>rich cultural heritage</span> of our First Nations people and their continuous ties to country, dating back more than 50,000 years.'),(88367,1931,'_threat_icons_0_thr_icon_text','field_64ec2551a93fb'),(88368,1931,'threat_icons_1_thr_icon',''),(88369,1931,'_threat_icons_1_thr_icon','field_64ec2551a93fa'),(88370,1931,'threat_icons_1_thr_icon_text','Thousands of species of plant and animal which are now classified as th