generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(90533,1939,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(90534,1939,'page_col_image_2','436'),(90535,1939,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(90536,1939,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(90537,1939,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(90538,1939,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(90539,1939,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(90540,1939,'page_col_image_4','455'),(90541,1939,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(90542,1939,'sec_4_title','Location'),(90543,1939,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(90544,1939,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(90545,1939,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(90546,1939,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(90547,1939,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(90548,1939,'news_title','Project updates'),(90549,1939,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(90550,1939,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(90551,1939,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(90552,1939,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(90553,1939,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(90554,1939,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(90555,1939,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(90556,1939,'contact_title','Contact us'),(90557,1939,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(90558,1939,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(90559,1939,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(90560,1939,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn