and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(91631,1940,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(91632,1940,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(91633,1940,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(91634,1940,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(91635,1940,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(91636,1940,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(91637,1940,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(91638,1940,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(91639,1940,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(91640,1940,'problem_icons','4'),(91641,1940,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(91642,1940,'ceh_content_left',''),(91643,1940,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(91644,1940,'ceh_content_right',''),(91645,1940,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(91646,1940,'pc_content_left',''),(91647,1940,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(91648,1940,'pc_content_right',''),(91649,1940,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(91650,1940,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(91651,1940,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(91652,1940