,1960,'_report_title','field_62f30edfb57e1'),(99229,1960,'report_intro','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus massa erat, consectetur at semper at, feugiat vel orci. '),(99230,1960,'_report_intro','field_62f30eedb57e2'),(99231,1960,'report_link_url','#'),(99232,1960,'_report_link_url','field_62f30ef4b57e3'),(99233,1960,'report_link_text','Download'),(99234,1960,'_report_link_text','field_62f30f01b57e4'),(99235,1960,'solutions_content','The housing system is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(99236,1960,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(99237,1960,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(99238,1960,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(99239,1960,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(99240,1960,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(99241,1960,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(99242,1960,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(99243,1960,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(99244,1960,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(99245,1960,'problem_icons','4'),(99246,1960,'_problem_icons','fiel