r the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(105184,2007,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(105185,2007,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(105186,2007,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(105187,2007,'page_col_image_4','455'),(105188,2007,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(105189,2007,'sec_4_title','Location'),(105190,2007,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(105191,2007,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(105192,2007,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(105193,2007,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(105194,2007,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(105195,2007,'news_title','Project updates'),(105196,2007,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(105197,2007,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(105198,2007,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(105199,2007,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(105200,2007,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(105201,2007,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(105202,2007,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(105203,2007,'contact_title','Contact us'),(105204,2007,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(105205,2007,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(105206,2007,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(105207,2007,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See all updates</a>'),(105208,2007,'_news_button','field_5de8329896e02'),(105209,2007,'timeline_intro','Introduction of timeline detail...'),(105210,2007,'_timeline_intro','field_5de98f5fb1781'),(105211,2007,'timeline_pic','477'),(105212,2007,'_timeline_pic','field_5de98f72b1782'),(105213,2007,'timeline_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-ne