steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(131388,2244,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(131389,2244,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(131390,2244,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(131391,2244,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(131392,2244,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(131393,2244,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(131394,2244,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(131395,2244,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(131396,2244,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(131397,2244,'problem_icons','4'),(131398,2244,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(131399,2244,'ceh_content_left',''),(131400,2244,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(131401,2244,'ceh_content_right',''),(131402,2244,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(131403,2244,'pc_content_left',''),(131404,2244,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(131405,2244,'pc_content_right',''),(131406,2244,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(131407,2244,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(131408,2244,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(131409,2244,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(131410,2244,