ion of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(173067,2586,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(173068,2586,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(173069,2586,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(173070,2586,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(173071,2586,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(173072,2586,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(173073,2586,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(173074,2586,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(173075,2586,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(173076,2586,'problem_icons','4'),(173077,2586,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(173078,2586,'ceh_content_left',''),(173079,2586,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(173080,2586,'ceh_content_right',''),(173081,2586,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(173082,2586,'pc_content_left',''),(173083,2586,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(173084,2586,'pc_content_right',''),(173085,2586,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(173086,2586,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(173087,2586,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(173088,2586,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(173089,2586,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(173090,2586,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(173091,2586,'_problem_icons_1_prob_