ble homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(182997,2677,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(182998,2677,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(182999,2677,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(183000,2677,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(183001,2677,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(183002,2677,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(183003,2677,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(183004,2677,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(183005,2677,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(183006,2677,'problem_icons','4'),(183007,2677,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(183008,2677,'ceh_content_left',''),(183009,2677,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(183010,2677,'ceh_content_right',''),(183011,2677,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(183012,2677,'pc_content_left',''),(183013,2677,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(183014,2677,'pc_content_right',''),(183015,2677,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(183016,2677,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(183017,2677,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(183018,2677,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(183019,2677,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(183020,2677,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(183021,2677,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerded_text