tween commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(186162,2700,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(186163,2700,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(186164,2700,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(186165,2700,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(186166,2700,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(186167,2700,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(186168,2700,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(186169,2700,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(186170,2700,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(186171,2700,'problem_icons','4'),(186172,2700,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(186173,2700,'ceh_content_left',''),(186174,2700,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(186175,2700,'ceh_content_right',''),(186176,2700,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(186177,2700,'pc_content_left',''),(186178,2700,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(186179,2700,'pc_content_right',''),(186180,2700,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(186181,2700,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(186182,2700,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(186183,2700,'problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','69% highly concerned'),(186184,2700,'_problem_icons_1_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(186185,2700,'problem_icons_