ore.'),(193658,2716,'_intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(193659,2716,'intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(193660,2716,'_intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(193661,2716,'intro_boxes_0_btn-text','Latest events'),(193662,2716,'_intro_boxes_0_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(193663,2716,'intro_boxes_1_btn-text','Latest projects'),(193664,2716,'_intro_boxes_1_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(193665,2716,'intro_boxes_2_btn-text','Latest ideas'),(193666,2716,'_intro_boxes_2_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(193667,2716,'display-easy-read',''),(193668,2716,'_display-easy-read','field_666129bd2da00'),(193669,2716,'hm_hero_sum','Statement about the issue and lost life savings'),(193670,2716,'_hm_hero_sum','field_64ed37241effa'),(193671,2716,'hm_hero_sub','When housing is affordable, communities thrive – that’s what  community made means. Homes built and managed by not-for-profits with purpose, not profit.'),(193672,2716,'_hm_hero_sub','field_64ed37241effa'),(193673,2716,'intro_head','We’re here to help.'),(193674,2716,'_intro_head','field_64e828783ad9f'),(193675,2716,'intro_content','About 12,000 people invested their hard-earned super savings in two investment funds which have now collapsed, called Shield Master Fund and First Guardian Master Fund. Most people will be entitled to get some money back, but you need to take action soon. This website has information and tools to help you understand what happened, where to get help and how to take back your super.'),(193676,2716,'_intro_content','field_66441acfe963c'),(193677,2716,'deadline_heading','Important deadlines'),(193678,2716,'_deadline_heading','field_69365ff82e6f2'),(193679,2716,'deadline_content','You need to take action before the deadline to take your super back.'),(193680,2716,'_deadline_content','field_693660342e6f3'),(193681,2716,'deadline_button_text','Find out more'),(193682,2716,'_deadline_button_text','field_693660482e6f4'),(1936