.'),(196986,2721,'first_image_cont','from 0-24 years living with disabilities and their familes'),(196987,2721,'_first_image_cont','field_5b67caff6afc5'),(196988,2720,'_intro_boxes_1_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(196989,2721,'first_image_button','<a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">Learn more</a>'),(196990,2721,'_first_image_button','field_5b67cb0d6afc6'),(196991,2720,'intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','Excerpt text here just a sentance or so and no more.'),(196992,2721,'second _image_title','Lifestart is about supporting young children'),(196993,2721,'_second _image_title','field_5b67cb20ddf9a'),(196994,2720,'_intro_boxes_2_box_excerpt','field_665975273e827'),(196995,2721,'second_image_cont','from 0-24 years living with disabilities and their familes'),(196996,2721,'_second_image_cont','field_5b67cb24ddf9b'),(196997,2720,'intro_boxes_0_btn-text','Latest events'),(196998,2721,'second_image_button','<a class=\"btn btn-blue\" href=\"/about/\">Learn more</a>'),(196999,2721,'_second_image_button','field_5b67cb29ddf9c'),(197000,2720,'_intro_boxes_0_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(197001,2721,'second_image_title','Lifestart is about supporting young children'),(197002,2721,'_second_image_title','field_5b67cb20ddf9a'),(197003,2720,'intro_boxes_1_btn-text','Latest projects'),(197004,2721,'page_col_image','412'),(197005,2721,'_page_col_image','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(197006,2720,'_intro_boxes_1_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(197007,2721,'page_col_image_3','437'),(197008,2720,'intro_boxes_2_btn-text','Latest ideas'),(197009,2721,'_page_col_image_3','field_5de6e3998e07e'),(197010,2721,'sec_2_title','Community'),(197011,2720,'_intro_boxes_2_btn-text','field_665abda8b8d4b'),(197012,2721,'_sec_2_title','field_5de6e3ef2798f'),(197013,2721,'sec_2_text','The project will be located about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. Sheep and cattle have grazed the undulating valleys and rocky outcrops across the region since the early days of European settlement.'),(197014,2720,'display-easy-read',''),(197015,2721,'_sec_2_text','field_5de78dc89e613'),(197016,2721,'sec_3_title','The Project'),(197017,2720,'_display-easy-read','field_666129bd2da00'),(197018,2721,'_sec_3_title','field_5de6e3d37d8da'),(197019,2721,'sec_3_text','The Valley of the Winds project is an 800 megawatt wind farm that is in the early stages of planning. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump that  will be capable of generating 2,000,000 megawatt hours of clean renewable energy each year.'),(197020,2720,'hm_hero_sum','Statement about the issue and lost life savings'),(197021,2721,'_sec_3_text','field_5de6e4044e5e8'),(197022,2721,'page_col_image_2','436'),(197023,2720,'_hm_hero_sum','field_64ed37241effa'),(197024,2721,'_page_col_image_2','field_5de6546e7c63a'),(197025,2720,'hm_hero_sub','When housing is affordable, communities thrive – that’s what  community made means. Homes built and managed by not-for-profits with purpose, not profit.'),(197026,2721,'sec_2_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/community\">More about the community</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Positives for the area</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#contact\">Contact us</a>\r\n'),(197027,2720,'_hm_hero_sub','field_64ed37241effa'),(197028,2721,'_sec_2_button','field_5de6e58c86706'),(197029,2720,'intro_head','We’re here to help.'),(197030,2721,'sec_3_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/the-project/\">Detailed project description</a> <a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"#location\">Location map</a>'),(197031,2720,'_intro_head','field_64e828783ad9f'),(197032,2721,'_sec_3_button','field_5de6e5a243c03'),(197033,2721,'page_col_image_4','455'),(197034,2720,'intro_content','About 12,000 people invested their hard-earned super savings in two investment funds which have now collapsed, called Shield Master Fund and First Guardian Master Fund. Most people will be entitled to get some money back, but you need to take action soon. This website has information and tools to help you understand what happened, where to get help and how to take back your super.'),(197035,2721,'_page_col_image_4','field_5de70801090ce'),(197036,2721,'sec_4_title','Location'),(197037,2720,'_intro_content','field_66441acfe963c'),(197038,2721,'_sec_4_title','field_5de7082a12a81'),(197039,2721,'sec_4_text','The project will be located in Central NSW about 5km south-west of the small rural township of Coolah. About 120 wind turbines are being proposed across two clusters at Mount Hope and Black Stump.'),(197040,2720,'deadline_heading','Important deadlines'),(197041,2721,'_sec_4_text','field_5de7084812a82'),(197042,2721,'sec_4_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" href=\"/hyveclean/about/\">Detailed location information</a>'),(197043,2720,'_deadline_heading','field_69365ff82e6f2'),(197044,2721,'_sec_4_button','field_5de7085e12a83'),(197045,2721,'news_title','Project updates'),(197046,2720,'deadline_content','You need to take action before the deadline to take your super back.'),(197047,2721,'_news_title','field_5de78da3aabb9'),(197048,2721,'sec_2_text_copy',''),(197049,2720,'_deadline_content','field_693660342e6f3'),(197050,2721,'_sec_2_text_copy','field_5de78dc89e613'),(197051,2721,'timeline-title','Timeline'),(197052,2720,'deadline_button_text','Find out more'),(197053,2721,'_timeline-title','field_5de78df29e615'),(197054,2721,'timeline_title','Timeline'),(197055,2720,'_deadline_button_text','field_693660482e6f4'),(197056,2721,'_timeline_title','field_5de78df29e615'),(197057,2721,'contact_title','Contact us'),(197058,2720,'deadline_button_url','/key-deadlines/'),(197059,2721,'_contact_title','field_5de7981e06057'),(197060,2720,'_deadline_button_url','field_693660912e6f5'),(197061,2721,'contact_intro','Contact text...'),(197062,2720,'what_head','Get involved'),(197063,2721,'_contact_intro','field_5de7983506058'),(197064,2721,'news_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home btn-news\" href=\"/updates/\">See 