ership increasingly out of reach for generations'),(203590,2738,'_issues_items_0_issues_item_txt','field_6a3b07fc06af3'),(203591,2738,'issues_items_0_issues_link_text',''),(203592,2738,'_issues_items_0_issues_link_text','field_6a3b080f06af4'),(203593,2738,'issues_items_0_issues_target_url',''),(203594,2738,'_issues_items_0_issues_target_url','field_6a3b082b06af5'),(203595,2738,'issues_items','3'),(203596,2738,'_issues_items','field_6a3b078206af0'),(203597,2738,'issues_items_1_issue_icon','2708'),(203598,2738,'_issues_items_1_issue_icon','field_6a3b07b506af1'),(203599,2738,'issues_items_1_issues_item_hd','The solutions we need '),(203600,2738,'_issues_items_1_issues_item_hd','field_6a3b07d706af2'),(203601,2738,'issues_items_1_issues_item_txt','Community housing works. We’re calling on the next NSW Government for three actions: long-term investment for new community housing, more funding to future-proof existing homes, and support to help people stayed housed.'),(203602,2738,'_issues_items_1_issues_item_txt','field_6a3b07fc06af3'),(203603,2738,'issues_items_1_issues_link_text',''),(203604,2738,'_issues_items_1_issues_link_text','field_6a3b080f06af4'),(203605,2738,'issues_items_1_issues_target_url',''),(203606,2738,'_issues_items_1_issues_target_url','field_6a3b082b06af5'),(203607,2738,'issues_items_0_issues_sub_head',''),(203608,2738,'_issues_items_0_issues_sub_head','field_6a3b0aa79365e'),(203609,2738,'issues_items_1_issues_sub_head',''),(203610,2738,'_issues_items_1_issues_sub_head','field_6a3b0aa79365e'),(203611,2738,'issues_items_2_issue_icon','2703'),(203612,2738,'_issues_items_2_issue_icon','field_6a3b07b506af1'),(203613,2738,'issues_items_2_issues_item_hd','The people next door'),(203614,2738,'_issues_items_2_issues_item_hd','field_6a3b07d706af2'),(203615,2738,'issues_items_2_issues_sub_head',''),(203616,2738,'_issues_items_2_issues_sub_head','field_6a3b0aa79365e'),(203617,2738,'issues_items_2_issues_item_txt','Nurses. Childcare workers. Single parents. Older Australians who want to stay near the people they love. Community housing is the solution.'),(203618,2738,'_issues_items_2_issues_item_txt','field_6a3b07fc06af3'),(203619,2738,'issues_items_2_issues_link_text',''),(203620,2738,'_issues_items_2_issues_link_text','field_6a3b080f06af4'),(203621,2738,'issues_items_2_issues_target_url',''),(203622,2738,'_issues_items_2_issues_target_url','field_6a3b082b06af5'),(203623,2738,'video_head','The people next door'),(203624,2738,'_video_head','field_6a5ff269ef234'),(203625,2738,'video_intro',''),(203626,2738,'_video_intro','field_6a606161b34b6'),(203629,2739,'footnotes',''),(203631,2739,'banner_head',''),(203632,2739,'_banner_head','field_5b568121a8ffe'),(203633,2739,'banner_sub',''),(203634,2739,'_banner_sub','field_5b568139fd366'),(203635,2739,'banner_button','<a class=\"btn btn-home\" style=\"width: 200px;\" href=\"#project\">Sign the petition</a>'),(203636,2739,'_banner_button','field_5b568147fd367'),(203637,2739,'support_section_title','How can Lifestart support you?'),(203638,2739,'_support_section_title','field_5b67c7d060398'),(203639,2739,'support_left_title','Services'),(203640,2739,'_support_left_title','field_5b67c298e7f8f'),(203641,2739,'support_left_cont','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy.'),(203642,2739,'_support_left_cont','field_5b67c5f6e7f91'),(203643,2739,'support_left_button','<a class=\"btn btn-green\" href=\"/services/\">View all services</a>'),(203644,2739,'_support_left_button','field_5b67c60ae7f92'),(203645,2739,'support_ctr_title','Talk to us'),(203646,2739,'_support_ctr_title','field_5b67c62a58af3'),(203647,2739,'support_ctr_cont','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet.'),(203648,2739,'_support_ctr_cont','field_5b67c63158af4'),(203649,2739,'support_ctr_button','<a class=\"btn btn-orange\" href=\"/supports/\">Find us</a>'),(203650,2739,'_support_ctr_button','field_5b67c63658af5'),(203651,2739,