is complex, and no one solution will solve the complex problems we now face but there are some critical first steps to be taken now.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Set out an ambitious national housing agreement between commonwealth and state governments with targets and funding for the construction of affordable homes.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out tax breaks for property investors and using the increase in revenue to build more public housing.</li>\r\n 	<li>Establish laws which limit rental increases beyond what is fair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Rebalance tenancy laws to provide renters with more security and control, such as eliminating no grounds evictions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Phase out stamp duty and replace it with a broad-based land tax.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>While there are many opinions on what policy changes will fix the housing market, doing nothing is not an option.</h4>'),(207936,2762,'_solutions_content','field_640e8b307a958'),(207937,2762,'problem_icons_0_prob_icon','1699'),(207938,2762,'_problem_icons_0_prob_icon','field_640fa0291d519'),(207939,2762,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','70% highly concerned'),(207940,2762,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerned_stat','field_640fa0dd81d95'),(207941,2762,'problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','are highly concerned'),(207942,2762,'_problem_icons_0_prob_concerded_text','field_640fa10181d96'),(207943,2762,'problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text',''),(207944,2762,'_problem_icons_0_prob_issue_text','field_640fa11a81d97'),(207945,2762,'problem_icons','4'),(207946,2762,'_problem_icons','field_640fa0191d518'),(207947,2762,'ceh_content_left',''),(207948,2762,'_ceh_content_left','field_640e97e8f1c8c'),(207949,2762,'ceh_content_right',''),(207950,2762,'_ceh_content_right','field_640e97fdf1c8d'),(207951,2762,'pc_content_left',''),(207952,2762,'_pc_content_left','field_640e983bf1c8f'),(207953,2762,'pc_content_right',''),(207954,2762,'_pc_content_right','field_640e984df1c90'),(207955,2762,'problem_icons_1_prob_icon','1699'),(207956,2762,'_problem_icons_1_prob_icon','