 nisl et arcu. Quisque sed eros metus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2022-08-10 02:28:20','2022-08-10 02:28:20','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1593',0,'revision','',0),(1594,1,'2022-08-10 02:29:48','2022-08-10 02:29:48','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Phasellus massa erat, consectetur at semper at, feugiat vel orci. Quisque consectetur egestas placerat. Mauris in nibh leo. Aliquam aliquet ut lectus ac aliquet. Sed id dignissim sapien. Integer vehicula, ligula dapibus vehicula varius, libero massa scelerisque ipsum, sed interdum ligula nisl et arcu. Quisque sed eros metus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2022-08-10 02:29:48','2022-08-10 02:29:48','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1594',0,'revision','',0),(1595,1,'2022-08-10 02:31:28','2022-08-10 02:31:28','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Get Updates</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sign up here for updates and important information</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Email</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"mailto:enquiries@superconsumers.com.au\">enquiries@superconsumers.com.au</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Contact Us</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<link href=\'https://actionnetwork.org/css/style-embed-v3.css\' rel=\'stylesheet\' type=\'text/css\' /><script src=\'https://actionnetwork.org/widgets/v5/form/e9bb558dac14cbb67826c9e6fb2c2694e19f53cd?format=js&source=widget\'></script><div id=\'can-form-area-e9bb558dac14cbb67826c9e6fb2c2694e19f53cd\' style=\'width: 100%\'><!-- this div is the target for our HTML insertion --></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/spacer {\"dividerColor\":\"#abb8c3\",\"dividerWidth\":100,\"dividerHeight\":2,\"uniqueID\":\"1595_1206ed-61\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-1595_1206ed-61\"><div class=\"kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center\"><hr class=\"kt-divider\"/></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Address: </strong>57 Carrington Road, Marrickville, Sydney NSW 2204</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@superconsumers.com.au\">enquiries@superconsumers.com.au</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Contact','','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2025-12-18 01:25:36','2025-12-18 01:25:36','',0,'http://localhost/?page_id=1595',0,'page','',0),(1596,1,'2022-08-10 02:31:28','2022-08-10 02:31:28','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For more information around the QHES please contact us via email at:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Energex </strong>and <strong>Ergon Energy Network (part of the Energy Queensland Group): </strong><a href=\"mailto:customeradvocacy@energyq.com.au\">customeradvocacy@energyq.com.au</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Powerlink Queensland</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:pqenquiries@powerlink.com.au\">pqenquiries@powerlink.com.au</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->','Contact','','inherit','closed','closed','','1595-revision-v1','','','2022-08-10 02:31:28','2022-08-10 02:31:28','',1595,'http://localhost/?p=1596',0,'revision','',0),(1602,1,'2022-08-10 02:32:36','2022-08-10 02:32:36','<!-- wp:paragra