uet ut lectus ac aliquet. Sed id dignissim sapien. Integer vehicula, ligula dapibus vehicula varius, libero massa scelerisque ipsum, sed interdum ligula nisl et arcu. Quisque sed eros metus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-01 04:44:32','2023-03-01 04:44:32','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1639',0,'revision','',0),(1640,1,'2023-03-02 04:58:15','2023-03-02 04:58:15','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Sentimrnt</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:file {\"id\":1281,\"href\":\"http://localhost:4000/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ECSS-March-2021-Household-Topline-Figures.pdf\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-49087114-4abb-405f-851d-88b5ba43c8ed\" href=\"http://localhost:4000/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ECSS-March-2021-Household-Topline-Figures.pdf\">ECSS March 2021 Household Topline Figures</a><a href=\"http://localhost:4000/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ECSS-March-2021-Household-Topline-Figures.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-49087114-4abb-405f-851d-88b5ba43c8ed\">Download</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:file -->','Downloads','','inherit','closed','closed','','1276-revision-v1','','','2023-03-02 04:58:15','2023-03-02 04:58:15','',1276,'http://localhost/?p=1640',0,'revision','',0),(1643,1,'2023-03-09 03:52:11','2023-03-09 03:52:11','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2><strong>Everybody’s home is different, but we all want the same thing: a place to build a fulfilling life.</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li><li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li><li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-09 03:52:11','2023-03-09 03:52:11','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1643',0,'revision','',0),(1644,1,'2023-03-09 03:52:56','2023-03-09 03:52:56','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><li>Renters are seeing huge price increases and insecure tenancy agreements.</li><li>First home buyers are struggling to scrape together a deposit.</li><li>Low-income families are facing years on the waiting list for social housing.</li></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Housing policies at the national, state, and local level are failing to provide reasonable pathways for people to find a place to call home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2023-03-09 03:52:56','2023-03-09 03:52:56','',6,'http://localhost/?p=1644',0,'revision','',0),(1646,1,'2023-03-09 05:22:41','2023-03-09 05:22:41','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can explore the results for households using the below category-tabs and within most sections you can sort the data by household-type, state/territory, region and other demographic characteristics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Housing affordability','','inherit','closed','closed','','1550-revision-v1','','','2023-03-09 05:22:41','2023-03-09 05:22:41','',1550,'http://localhost/?p=1646',0,'revision','',0),(1647,1,'2023-03-09 05:23:12','2023-03-09 05:23:12','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Australia is a rich country, but despite our growing national wealth, for many people the Australian dream seems increasingly out of reach.</p>\n<